        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Konstantin Arkadyevich Raikin, Arkady Raikin\n- Roles: actor, theatre director, humorist\n- Organizations: Moscow Satyricon Theatre\n- Places: Leningrad, USSR\n- Topics: Soviet and Russian humor\n\nFacts:\n- Konstantin Arkadyevich Raikin was born on July 8, 1950, in Leningrad, USSR.\n- Konstantin Arkadyevich Raikin is a Russian actor and theatre director.\n- Since 1988, Konstantin Arkadyevich Raikin has been the head of the Moscow Satyricon Theatre.\n- Arkady Raikin led the school of Soviet and Russian humorists for about half a century.",
